--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party benchmark data (assets/bench/*.json)

The benchmark manifests reference images by URL with SHA-256 pins and carry
ground-truth boxes derived from the datasets below. No images are included in
this repository; they are downloaded from the original hosts on demand.
See docs/BENCH_IMAGES.md.

- bmd45-cctv: BMD-45 Bengaluru Mobility Dataset, AI for Integrated Mobility
  (AIM) group, Indian Institute of Science (IISc), Bengaluru; imagery courtesy
  of Bengaluru Traffic Police / Bengaluru Police Safe City. CC BY 4.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/iisc-aim/BMD-45 . Annotations were remapped
  to COCO classes and subsetted.
- exdark-night: ExDark (Exclusively Dark Image Dataset), Yuen Peng Loh and
  Chee Seng Chan, Universiti Malaya, BSD-3-Clause
  (https://github.com/cs-chan/Exclusively-Dark-Image-Dataset); the authors ask
  that commercial use be cleared with them. YOLO export by Roboflow Universe
  (my-workspace-ohnbt/exclusively-dark-image v2, labelled CC BY 4.0),
  redistributed at https://huggingface.co/datasets/dronefreak/ExDark .
  Annotations were remapped to COCO classes and subsetted.
- coco-cctv: Microsoft COCO val2017 (Lin et al., 2014), annotations
  CC BY 4.0 by the COCO Consortium (https://cocodataset.org); images remain
  under their individual Flickr licences. Annotations were remapped to the
  project's COCO-80 spellings and subsetted.
